OL,3,GNEWSACameras to enforce town's daytime
OL,4,Atraffic ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCameras are to be installed to help
OL,7,Fenforce a daytime high street traffic
OL,8,Fban in a bid to make the area more
OL,9,Fpedestrian-friendly.
OL,11,FCornwall Council has announced that
OL,12,Fcameras will be installed at both ends
OL,13,Fof Market Jew Street in Penzance and
OL,14,Fwill operate from 28 September.
OL,16,FRestrictions preventing cars and
OL,17,Fdelivery vehicles from entering the
OL,18,Fstreet between 11:00 BST and 16:00 BST
OL,19,Fhave been in place since 2020 to
OL,20,Fprovide space for pedestrians and
OL,21,Fcyclists.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
