OL,3,GNEWSACameras to enforce town's daytime
OL,4,Atraffic ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the ban has been widely
OL,7,Fignored, with council figures showing
OL,8,Fthat up to 600 vehicles a day are
OL,9,Fcontinuing to use the route during the
OL,10,Frestricted period.
